"""Deterministic checks for the Trainyard CI ledger repair.

Stage 1 outputs are compared with digests of the expected ledger (field by
field projections, every row). The repaired package is installed from the
agent's package.zip on a plain Python 3.12 with only the dependencies its
pyproject declares, and run on the hidden stage-2 feed embedded below,
opened from the agent's own stage-1 summary.json. The stage-2 checks grade
the run on a copy of that feed whose files carry fresh names.
"""

